From 50a132c5ee98ea9f63ddcd86ee82911f658f5e8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Git Gud <gg@local>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 13:41:30 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] gpui: per-run font size
 (TextRun/FontRun/ShapedRun.font_size), cosmic-text spans with their own
 metrics

Lets a run (inline code) be drawn smaller than the line it sits in. Linux/wgpu implements it; macOS and Windows keep the line size (the field is accepted and ignored there).
